{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22415","headline":"夜闻歌者 · 白居易","name":"夜闻歌者","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜泊鹦鹉洲，江月秋澄澈。\n邻船有歌者，发词堪愁绝。\n歌罢继以泣，泣声通复咽。\n寻声见其人，有妇颜如雪。\n独倚帆樯立，娉婷十七八。\n夜泪如真珠，双双堕明月。\n借问谁家妇，歌泣何凄切。\n一问一沾襟，低眉终不说。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22415.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22415","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}